WEBVTT

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:01.096
It was a palette that I didn't
have to search far for

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:02.536
and look for in a treatise,

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:03.840
because I already knew it.

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:10.000
What kind of painter
emerges from this reality?

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:15.080
What color is urban?

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.440
What color is ghetto?

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:21.600
What color is privilege?

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:24.920
What color is gang-related?

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:28.040
What color is gentrification?

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:31.480
What color is Freddie Gray?